# Active learning daemon runtime artifacts:
#
# .DATA/ covers state.json, journal.ndjson,
# recent_seeds.json, seed_frame_id_index.json, and the various
# *.lock files since the daemon writes them all under
# <campaign>/.DATA/ACTIVE_LEARNING/.
# The patterns below cover the
# campaign root subtrees that hold committed iterations and the
# per-pointdir sidecars that live outside .DATA/.

